/*
  BrowserPushChannelCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0181 · BrowserPushChannelCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `BrowserPushChannelCard` resolves (table "BrowserPushChannelCard") lives here with
  its web value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/notifications/components/BrowserPushChannelCard.tsx, namespace "webpush").
  Group 2 backs the `formatRelative` port (web lib/dateFormat) reproduced inline.
  Group 3 backs the native-only chrome (registered-device empty state, freshness
  chip, loading / error / retry).
*/

